# DailyDash does not load application credentials from the repository-root .env.
#
# Local operational credentials belong in the generated Windmill runtime:
#
#   ../daily-dash-windmill-local/secrets/
#
# In particular:
#   telegram_token
#   telegram_chat_id
#   openrouter_api_key
#   data_repo_deploy_key
#
# See docs/09_LOCAL_WINDMILL_BOOTSTRAP.md.
#
# Explicit environment variables may still be supplied by tests, CI, or an
# external secret manager, but this file is intentionally credential-free.
